  "question": {
    "text": "Consider a hydrogen-like ionized atom with atomic number <math> <mi>Z</mi> </math> with a single electron. In the emission spectrum of this atom, the photon emitted in the <math><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>1</mn></math> transition has energy <math><mn>74.8</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>eV</mi></math> higher than the photon emitted in the <math><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> transition. Given that the ionization energy of the hydrogen atom is <math><mn>13.6</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>eV</mi></math>, what is the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Z</mi></math>?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mo>∆</mo><msub><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn> <mo>&#x2192;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>13.6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>13.6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>∆</mo><msub><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn> <mo>&#x2192;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>13.6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>13.6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>36</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>∆</mo><msub><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn> <mo>&#x2192;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>∆</mo><msub><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>74.8</mn></math><br /><math><mn>13.6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>13.6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>36</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>74.8</mn></math><br /><math><mn>13.6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><